# Recorded eval runs — integrity anchor for the claim-support rollout.
#
# release_release-1.jsonl is the 66-answer release run of 2026-08-19 and is the
# baseline every later --compare is measured against. It cannot be rebuilt: a
# re-run calls the model 66 more times and is a different sample. Verify before
# trusting any number derived from these files, and after any git operation
# that touched data/eval/:
#
#     sha256sum -c data/eval/CHECKSUMS.sha256      # run from the repo root
#
# Regenerate ONLY when deliberately adding a new recorded run:
#     sha256sum data/eval/release_*.jsonl data/eval/answers_baseline_*.jsonl
#
